   "ihh:key": "einstein:ch:history:opening",
   "ihh:lineKind": "opening",
   "ihh:text": "In 1939, six years after he first came to Princeton, Albert Einstein signed a letter to President Roosevelt. Take your time here.",
   "ihh:source": [
    "Albert Einstein signed a letter to President Roosevelt.",
    "When Albert Einstein first came to Princeton in 1933, he lived at 2 Library Place.",
    "Alexander Sachs delivered Einstein's letter to President Roosevelt on October 11, 1939."
   ],
