   "ihh:creditsSection": "app/CREDITS.md, section \"112 Mercer Street front (app/public/models/einstein-mercer-street-front, built from assets-src/einstein-mercer-street-front)\"",
   "name": "112 Mercer Street, Princeton",
   "ihh:tourLabel": "Recreation based on photographs: 112 Mercer Street, Princeton, New Jersey, the house front and street. Basis: Alan Richards, \"Albert Einstein's house\" (undated, winter), Shelby White and Leon Levy Archives Center, Institute for Advanced Study, IAS E 42 (CC BY 4.0); an undated colour view and a National Park Service photograph used as reference. The photographs show the house after Einstein's lifetime; it was his home until his death in 1955. Snow, wires, cars and people are not shown."
  },
  {
