   "ihh:model": "app/public/models/naismith-presbyterian-dining-hall/naismith-presbyterian-dining-hall.glb",
   "ihh:glbLabel": "Recreation based on a photograph: Presbyterian College, Montreal, the dining room, April 1889 (Wm. Notman & Son, McCord Stewart Museum II-89481, used as a modelling reference). The photograph shows students at dinner; it does not name them. James Naismith entered the college in 1887. People are not shown; the walls the photograph does not show are plain.",
