   "ihh:creditsSection": "app/CREDITS.md, section \"Presbyterian College dining room, Montreal (app/public/models/naismith-presbyterian-dining-hall, built from assets-src/naismith-presbyterian-dining-hall)\"",
   "name": "Presbyterian College, Montreal · the dining room",
   "ihh:tourLabel": "Recreation based on a photograph of the dining room of the Presbyterian College, Montreal, by Wm. Notman & Son (McCord Stewart Museum II-89481, used as a modelling reference; its date is not verified). The photograph shows students at dinner; it does not name them. James Naismith entered the college in 1887. People are not shown; the walls the photograph does not show are plain."
