  {
   "@id": "ihh:line-naismith:ch:big-work:opening",
   "@type": "SpeakableSpecification",
   "ihh:key": "naismith:ch:big-work:opening",
   "ihh:lineKind": "opening",
   "ihh:text": "James Naismith coached basketball. In 1898, Kansas hired him, seven years after he invented it. Walk around, if you like.",
   "ihh:source": [
    "James Naismith coached basketball at the University of Kansas.",
    "In 1898, James Naismith was hired by the University of Kansas to coach basketball.",
    "In December 1891 Naismith invented basketball in Springfield."
   ],
   "citation": [
    {
     "@id": "ihh:NAI-F-0051"
    },
    {
