   "ihh:tourLabel": "Recreation based on photographs: the tower hoisting a symbolic basketball outside the present Naismith Memorial Basketball Hall of Fame, Springfield, Massachusetts, Carol M. Highsmith, 2019, Library of Congress (public domain). James Naismith was inducted into the Basketball Hall of Fame in 1959; the photographs show the present building and its grounds. Vehicles are not shown."
