     "ihh:ownerRuling": "Owner ruling 2026-10-26 (DECISIONS 2026-10-26): within HABS record MUI-M-0015, Photo 13 (Jack E. Boucher, National Park Service staff photographer, October 1960) and the survey sheets are public domain as federal work; the bundled 1900 and c.1920 photographs stay modelling-only."
