   "name": "The study, John Muir House",
   "ihh:tourLabel": "Recreation based on the Historic American Buildings Survey record of the John Muir House (Library of Congress): a HABS photograph of the bedroom and study, from which the wallpaper is taken, and the measured drawings. The room is shown as HABS photographed it, after the house was refurnished; the furnishings are not Muir's own."
  },
