  {
   "@id": "ihh:photo-room-albright-birth",
   "@type": "CreativeWork",
   "additionalType": "ihh:PhotoRoom",
   "name": "Old Town Square, Prague (about 1928)",
   "description": "Photo room — based on a Library of Congress stereograph (public domain): Keystone View Company, “Old town square and Teyn Church, Prague, Czechoslovakia”, c1928 (the photograph may date from 1910-1919; right image). A view of the city where Madeleine Albright was born; no source on file records the address of her birthplace. The photograph is small, so it is soft. The depth is estimated from the photograph; past its edges there is nothing to show.",
   "ihh:shownIn": [
    {
     "ihh:inductee": "albright",
     "ihh:chapter": "birth",
