   "ihh:model": "app/public/models/albright-ss-america/albright-ss-america.glb",
   "ihh:glbLabel": "Recreation based on a photograph: S.S. America (United States Lines), tourist lounge, Gottscho-Schleisner, 18 October 1940 (Library of Congress). One source says Madeleine Albright arrived in the United States as a young girl aboard the SS America in 1948; no source records her class or that she used this room, and the ship was refitted after the war. Colours are interpretive: the photograph is black and white.",
   "ihh:shownIn": [
    {
     "ihh:inductee": "albright",
     "ihh:chapter": "arriving",
     "ihh:chapterTitle": "Into New York Harbor",
     "ihh:placeLabel": "A liner’s tourist lounge (1940)"
    }
   ],
   "ihh:texturesFrom": [
    {
     "@id": "ihh:ALB-M-0076",
     "ihh:mediaId": "ALB-M-0076",
     "ihh:what": "the needlework panel and the patterned upholstery (softened crops)"
    }
   ],
   "ihh:sourcesFile": "assets-src/albright-ss-america/SOURCES.md",
   "ihh:inventoryFile": "assets-src/albright-ss-america/INVENTORY.md",
   "ihh:creditsSection": "app/CREDITS.md, section \"S.S. America tourist lounge, 1940 (app/public/models/albright-ss-america, built from assets-src/albright-ss-america)\"",
   "name": "A liner’s tourist lounge · 1940",
   "ihh:tourLabel": "Recreation based on a photograph: “S.S. America, United States Lines. Tourist lounge, general”, Gottscho-Schleisner, October 18, 1940 (Library of Congress). A public room of a transatlantic liner as photographed in 1940. No verified source on file names the ship Madeleine Albright crossed on, and she is not known to have been in this room. Recreated from a small photograph: forms and tones, details plain; colours are interpretive."
  },
  {
   "@id": "ihh:line-albright:ch:arriving:opening",
   "@type": "SpeakableSpecification",
   "ihh:key": "albright:ch:arriving:opening",
   "ihh:lineKind": "opening",
   "ihh:text": "In 1948, eleven years after she was born in Prague, Madeleine Albright steamed into New York Harbor, past the Statue of Liberty: her family immigrated to the United States. Take a moment and look around.",
   "ihh:source": [
    "Madeleine Albright was born on May 15, 1937.",
    "Madeleine Albright was born in Prague.",
    "In 1948 Albright's family immigrated to the United States.",
    "Albright steamed into New York Harbor, past the Statue of Liberty."
   ],
   "citation": [
    {
     "@id": "ihh:ALB-F-0003"
    },
