   "ihh:speak": "Here are photographs of the naturalization ceremony at the National Archives in Washington, D.C., on September 14, 2016, and of the rotunda, prepared for it. Fifty-nine years after she became a U.S. citizen, she was at the ceremony to make remarks.",
   "ihh:narratesRecords": [
    {
     "@id": "ihh:record-ALB-SERIES-CEREMONY-2016"
    }
   ],
   "about": {
    "@id": "ihh:person-albright"
   }
