   "ihh:glbLabel": "Recreation based on a photograph: U.N. Security Council Chamber, Bernard Gotfryd, between 1977 and 1981 (Library of Congress, LC-GB05-5929). Madeleine Albright was U.S. Permanent Representative to the United Nations 1993-1997; the chamber is shown as photographed about 15 years earlier.",
