   "ihh:speak": "On January twenty-second, 1997, Madeleine Albright was confirmed as Secretary of State by the U.S. Senate. She was sworn in, in the Oval Office, on January twenty-third, 1997, and Vice President Gore administered the oath of office. Take a moment and look around.",
