      "Used for": "Geometry: the room's proportions, pilasters on pedestals, entablature, ceiling beams and rosettes, three chandeliers, the west wall's doors (single, double, single) with their entablatures and panels, mantels with mirrors, draped windows on the east and north walls, herringbone parquet. Comparison camera (cam_1904). No texture."
     }
    },
