   "name": "Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer studios, Culver City",
   "ihh:tourLabel": "Recreation modelled after a photograph used as reference only (Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer studios, Culver City; Los Angeles Daily News Negatives, UCLA Library Special Collections; its date is not verified here). The banner and plate lettering is re-set; nothing is cut from the photograph. People and cars in the photograph are not shown."
