  {
   "@id": "ihh:line-lamarr:ch:first-work:opening",
   "@type": "SpeakableSpecification",
   "ihh:key": "lamarr:ch:first-work:opening",
   "ihh:lineKind": "opening",
   "ihh:text": "In 1940, three years after New York saw her, Hedy Lamarr was in Boom Town, a Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer picture. Walk around, if you like.",
   "ihh:source": [
    "The 1940 motion picture poster for the Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer picture Boom Town shows Hedy Lamarr in scenes from the movie.",
    "The Waterbury Democrat (Waterbury, Conn.), October 4, 1937, on Austrian Hedy Kiesler: Now Miss Kiesler is here in person (above as New York saw her)."
   ],
   "citation": [
