  {
   "@id": "ihh:line-lamarr:ch:big-work:opening",
   "@type": "SpeakableSpecification",
   "ihh:key": "lamarr:ch:big-work:opening",
   "ihh:lineKind": "opening",
   "ihh:text": "In 1941, a year after Hedy Lamarr met George Antheil, she and Antheil signed at Los Angeles as inventors of the Secret Communication System. The Secret Communication System was filed June 10, 1941. Take your time here.",
   "ihh:source": [
    "In 1940 Lamarr met George Antheil.",
    "Secret Communication System, by Hedy Kiesler Markey and George Antheil, was filed June 10, 1941.",
    "In 1941 Hedy Kiesler Markey and George Antheil signed at Los Angeles, Calif., as inventors of the Secret Communication System."
   ],
   "citation": [
    {
     "@id": "ihh:LAM-F-0086"
    },
    {
     "@id": "ihh:LAM-F-0091"
    },
