   "ihh:text": "In 1942, Hedy Lamarr, as Heddy Lamar [sic], was on war bond tours with the film entertainers. Take your time here.",
   "ihh:source": [
    "EVERYBODY JOINS U.S. WAR EFFORT [ETC.] (1942) has film entertainers on war bond tours, including Heddy Lamar.",
    "On the September bond selling tour of the motion picture stars, Hedy Lamarr was at a rally at Military Common, Orange, N. J."
   ],
